<title>UK: DHL UK names Paterson sales develop manager.</title>
<headline>DHL UK names Paterson sales develop manager.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>DHL International (UK) Limited said on Monday it has appointed David Paterson as sales development manager.</p>
<p>It added Paterson has recently been working as an independent management consultant with with a range of clients including Triangle Management Service, British Airways and a number of airline aviation services clients in the Middle East. -- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
